{
	// The skills settlers learn by doing. Each goes from level 0 to 20 (config SkillLevelMax). Level n costs
	// SkillXpPerLevel x n XP up to level 10, then twice as much growth per step (SkillSteepFrom/Factor). A skill with a "job" grows from that job's work and makes it faster: each
	// usable level cuts the work time by "workSpeedPerLevel". Skills without a job (strength, fitness)
	// grow for everyone. How much of a skill counts ("usable") is limited by the level of the hut the
	// settler works at, or of the Residence they sleep in for strength and fitness; see
	// SkillCapByBuildingLevel in the config.
	// "perks": milestone bonuses, one value for each level in config SkillPerkLevels (5, 10, 15, 20); a job
	// skill's perks work in that job, Strength's and Fitness's always. Keys: "yield" (chance of one more item
	// from a piece of work), "portion" (chance of one more serving or piece when cooking), "packSlots"
	// (extra slots), "toolWear", "swingSpeed", "workSpeed", "hunger" (multipliers).
	"skills": [
